# PyCharm
#  JetBrains specific template is maintainted in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Labeled Faces in the Wild dataset (problem-sets/07-facial-recognition-pca):
# it's already committed in this repo's git history (~266MB across 13k+
# files), so this line alone won't shrink the repo, but it stops the data
# from being re-added if it's ever removed from tracking and history-rewritten
# (see README for details on that tradeoff).
problem-sets/07-facial-recognition-pca/lfw_funneled/

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/

# Local-only folders: not part of the public portfolio
# _reference_not_my_work/ holds instructor-authored material (solution keys,
# lecture slides) kept for personal study, not for public redistribution.
# _to_delete/ holds redundant PDF/HTML exports and accidental duplicate
# files staged for cleanup, kept temporarily for review before deleting.
_reference_not_my_work/
_to_delete/